From: ps5cemu <ps5cemu@localhost>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 18:40:57 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] PS5: the OTP and CTCert locked against AM's title scan

A New 3DS's Artic Setup after an Old 3DS's crashed as it began, reading
a null pointer in HW::ECC::CreateECCPublicKey: AM scans the installed
titles on a thread of its own (std::async), and the Old 3DS's setup had
installed titles encrypted with the console's unique key, which the
scan opens with the CTCert's public key, while Artic Setup wrote the
console's data and invalidated the OTP and CTCert on the main thread.
BuildECC sets the certificate's signature type, which IsValid reads,
before its public key, so the scan found a valid certificate with no
key. LoadOTP, InvalidateSecureData and GetUniqueCryptoFileKeyIV take a
lock (recursive: the last loads the OTP).
---
 src/core/hw/unique_data.cpp | 10 ++++++++++
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/core/hw/unique_data.cpp b/src/core/hw/unique_data.cpp
index 8106505..04a8cca 100644
--- a/src/core/hw/unique_data.cpp
+++ b/src/core/hw/unique_data.cpp
@@ -2,6 +2,7 @@
 // Licensed under GPLv2 or any later version
 // Refer to the license.txt file included.
 
+#include <mutex>
 #include <cryptopp/sha.h>
 #include "common/common_paths.h"
 #include "common/file_derived.h"
@@ -26,6 +27,12 @@ static FileSys::OTP otp;
 static FileSys::Certificate ct_cert;
 static MovableSedFull movable;
 static bool movable_signature_valid = false;
+// The OTP and the CTCert built from it, used from AM's title scan (its own thread, std::async) while
+// Artic Setup writes the console's data and invalidates them (artic.cpp): a scan that found the
+// CTCert half-built (BuildECC sets its signature type, which IsValid reads, before its public key)
+// read the key from a null pointer, a New 3DS's setup over an Old 3DS's installed titles crashing
+// as it began. Recursive: GetUniqueCryptoFileKeyIV loads the OTP.
+static std::recursive_mutex otp_mutex;
 
 bool SecureInfoA::VerifySignature() const {
     auto sec_info_slot = HW::RSA::GetSecureInfoSlot();
@@ -141,6 +148,7 @@ SecureDataLoadStatus LoadLocalFriendCodeSeedB() {
 }
 
 SecureDataLoadStatus LoadOTP() {
+    std::scoped_lock lock(otp_mutex);
     if (otp.Valid()) {
         return SecureDataLoadStatus::Loaded;
     }
@@ -277,6 +285,7 @@ MovableSedFull& GetMovableSed() {
     return movable;
 }
 void InvalidateSecureData() {
+    std::scoped_lock lock(otp_mutex);
     secure_info_a.Invalidate();
     local_friend_code_seed_b.Invalidate();
     otp.Invalidate();
@@ -286,6 +295,7 @@ void InvalidateSecureData() {
 
 static bool GetUniqueCryptoFileKeyIV(std::vector<u8>& out_key, std::vector<u8>& out_iv,
                                      UniqueCryptoFileID id) {
+    std::scoped_lock lock(otp_mutex);
 
     LoadOTP();
 
